# Go 1.21 - strings.Title is deprecated but still works
# Let me also check what happens with the title case for return names

# "min" → "wantMin", "max" → "wantMax"
# "head" → "wantHead", "tail" → "wantTail"
# "result" → "wantResult"
# "err" → error (handled separately)

# strings.Title works: Title("min") = "Min", Title("max") = "Max"
# So "want" + Title(name) = "wantMin", "wantMax"

# And for gotVar: "got" + Title(name) = "gotMin", "gotMax"

# Now let me completely rewrite the render package properly
